# Icons

Prefer existing Bootstrap Icons (`bi bi-*`) when a clear match already exists in the sidebar or page.

When Bootstrap Icons does not have an obvious icon (for example a clinician, specialty resource, or uncommon concept), use [Iconify](https://icon-sets.iconify.design/) via the `iconify-icon` web component already loaded in `index.html`:

```html
<iconify-icon icon="mdi:doctor" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>
```

- Browse sets at https://icon-sets.iconify.design/ (Material Design `mdi:` is a good default)
- Do not invent Bootstrap Icon class names
- Style `iconify-icon` like neighboring `i.bi` icons (inherit color, ~1.15rem size)
